  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Cities Initiative in Action for Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide an important contribution to the achievement of FAO Green Cities Initiative&apos; s vision and mission. Ten African cities will identify local actions for climate adaption and resilience.  The proposed actions will be analysed and prioritized through a cost-benefits analysis and impact assessment, FAO will then formulate a comprehensive Climate Adaptation Programme to be submitted to the Italian Climate Fund and other donors.</narrative>
  </description>
